This executable statically links the following third-party software components
from OpenMM 8.2.0 (commit 53770948682c40bd460b39830d4e0f0fd3a4b868,
https://github.com/openmm/openmm) and cpp-dsl-sdk:
only the MIT/BSD/zlib/permissive OpenMM API, Reference Platform, CPU Platform,
and their permissive bundled support libraries are compiled; the LGPL CUDA,
OpenCL, and CPU-PME plugin libraries are excluded and not compiled or linked.

